{"id":8984860,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/9613","number":9613,"state":"merged","title":"fix(indexer_quant_cache): reject odd cache headDim for MX-FP4 mode","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9613","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9613/issues","body":"## 描述\n\n修复 `indexer_quant_cache` 算子在 `quantMode=3`（MX-FP4）模式下，`cache.headDim` 为奇数时产生精度错误/数据错位的问题。\n\n**根因**：MX-FP4 每字节打包 2 个 fp4 逻辑元素。当 `headDim` 为奇数时，相邻逻辑行的起始位置会交替落在字节的高 4 位 / 低 4 位。当前 kernel 把 `cache` 声明为 `GlobalTensor<int8_t>`，仅支持整字节地址的 `CopyOut`，无法表达这种半字节偏移，导致输出数据错位/精度错误。\n\n**修复方案**：在 host tiling (`indexer_quant_cache_tiling_arch35.cpp`) 的 `CalcOpTiling` 中新增校验——`quantMode=3` 时要求 `cache.headDim`（连续场景）以及 cache 分页 view 的 row/block stride（分页场景）必须为偶数，不满足则直接返回 `GRAPH_FAILED`，从\"跑出错误数据\"变为\"直接报错拒绝非法输入\"。同步更新文档约束说明，并新增 host UT 拒绝用例。\n\n该做法与 CANN 内其他 FP4/MX-FP4 打包量化算子（如 `scatter_pa_kv_cache` 对 `k_head_size`/`v_head_size` 的偶数校验、`dynamic_mx_quant` 对 `input.shape[-1]` 的偶数要求）保持一致——均选择在 host tiling 阶段拒绝奇数尾轴，而不是尝试支持半字节寻址。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n\n关联 Issue #4137\n\n## 测试\n\n- **端到端验证**：用 TTK aclnn 模式构造了 headDim=65（奇数）和 headDim=64（偶数）两个 MX-FP4 用例，前者 `aclnnIndexerQuantCacheGetWorkspaceSize` 阶段报错拒绝（`ACLNN_ERR_INNER_NULLPTR`），plog 确认报错发生在 `indexer_quant_cache_tiling_arch35.cpp:332`，未进入 kernel；后者正常执行，精度 PASS。\n- **Host UT**：新增测试用例 `indexer_quant_cache_tiling_mxfp4_odd_headdim_rejected`，验证奇数 headDim（129）在 tiling 阶段返回 `GRAPH_FAILED`。（本机 host UT 框架本身有环境问题——`TilingContext` 构造为空指针、所有用例均 segfault，与本次改动无关，已用 gdb 确认崩溃点在框架代码 `tiling_case_executor.cpp:316` 而非算子逻辑）\n\n## 文档更新\n\n更新了 `attention/indexer_quant_cache/docs/aclnnIndexerQuantCache.md` 的约束说明，新增一条：\n> **MX-FP4（quantMode=3）模式下，cache.headDim 必须为偶数**。\n\n## 类型标签\n\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [x] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":33,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","login":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","name":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d1dab3a86414eb5ba6e9","login":"gitee-duhuiping","name":"gitee-duhuiping","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gitee-duhuiping","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c79924adff5452d7b9b8","login":"yang-binrong","name":"yang-binrong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yang-binrong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c187053cff786c91063e","login":"xuanyuandy","name":"xuanyuandy","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuanyuandy","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"691ecac49f2d096fd9f4b80f","login":"caiwenwen","name":"caiwenwen","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/caiwenwen","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68ae71005a5e89101cc27390","login":"Ww7012","name":"Ww7012","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/df/ad/df8686a5d8b2c85f6fdabb935ab38cf0b63f00cb81132c00c7fe9b61743a9ae0.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Ww7012","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"http